{
  "file_id": "3550",
  "text_count": 189,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Where are we? Did we get blown\naway by the wind?",
      "_offset": 2575,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Huh? There's a restaurant there.",
      "_offset": 2632,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Let's go check it out! Maybe we'll\ndiscover something!",
      "_offset": 2665,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "All right, I'll have the usual\nshaved ice.",
      "_offset": 2720,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Me too!",
      "_offset": 2763,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "All right, got it! Thank you for\nyour continued patronage!",
      "_offset": 2771,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Hey, you! Go find more customers!",
      "_offset": 2830,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "*sigh*",
      "_offset": 2864,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Hm?! Gomamon!",
      "_offset": 2871,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Gomamon!",
      "_offset": 2885,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Gabumon...? And Yamato!",
      "_offset": 2894,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "So does that mean Jou's here?",
      "_offset": 2918,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Yeah! He's over here! Come with\nme!",
      "_offset": 2948,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Jou! So you were here!",
      "_offset": 2984,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Ah, well...",
      "_offset": 3007,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "After everyone left, it was just\nme and Takeru...",
      "_offset": 3019,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Well, after we all split up, while\nwe were looking for food...",
      "_offset": 3069,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "a Digimon who said he'd seen\nhumans led us astray.",
      "_offset": 3132,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "So that's what happened...",
      "_offset": 3183,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "We wanted to come back, but we got\nlost. And when we started getting\nhungry, we found this place...",
      "_offset": 3210,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "So then, why are you working here?",
      "_offset": 3310,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "\"We only take dollars, not\nJapanese yen! You have to work off\nwhat you ate!\" he said.",
      "_offset": 3345,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "So you're saying you *have* to\nwork here.",
      "_offset": 3431,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "You're too slow! The customers are\nwaiting! Hurry up and get the food\nout!",
      "_offset": 3473,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Y-yes, sir!",
      "_offset": 3548,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Hm? Who're you?",
      "_offset": 3560,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "I'm his friend.",
      "_offset": 3576,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Hmph! Whaddya want?",
      "_offset": 3592,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "How much longer does he have to\nwork?",
      "_offset": 3612,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Well, it was originally supposed\nto be only three days...",
      "_offset": 3650,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "...but every time I mess up he\nadds more, so it's around two\nweeks now!",
      "_offset": 3708,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "He's terrible! I suffer losses due\nto him, so I'm just having him\nmake it up!",
      "_offset": 3780,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "What's going on, what's with all\nthe fighting?",
      "_offset": 3858,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Mr. Digitamamon!",
      "_offset": 3905,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "So you're the owner. This is my\nfriend. Hasn't he worked enough?",
      "_offset": 3922,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Don't make me laugh! Although if\nyou worked the debt off with him,\nit'd be a different story...",
      "_offset": 3987,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "About that...",
      "_offset": 4083,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "If you can't, you're getting in\nthe way of business.",
      "_offset": 4097,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Am I gonna be stuck here for the\nrest of my life?",
      "_offset": 4150,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Takeru's waiting for me, so I'll\nbe back. Wait for me.",
      "_offset": 4200,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Huh? Then...!",
      "_offset": 4255,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Then, I'll help you work. Sound\ngood?",
      "_offset": 4269,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Yamato! I'm in your debt!",
      "_offset": 4307,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Oh? You're PicoDevimon...",
      "_offset": 4333,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "I have a favor to ask of you. Of\ncourse, I'll pay you handsomely.",
      "_offset": 4359,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "So? What do you want me to do?",
      "_offset": 4425,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Nothing much, just something\neasy...",
      "_offset": 4456,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Wait! Where do you think you're\ngoing?",
      "_offset": 4493,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Where...?",
      "_offset": 4532,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "You're going to come back and work\nwith him!",
      "_offset": 4542,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Huh? What's with the turning heel\nall of a sudden?",
      "_offset": 4587,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "So, you don't care about what'll\nhappen to your friend in the\nmeantime?",
      "_offset": 4638,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 4710,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "What should we do, Yamato?",
      "_offset": 4717,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Go see Takeru, Yamato. I'll be\nfine.",
      "_offset": 4748,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "No, it's fine.",
      "_offset": 4785,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Aren't you worried about Takeru?\nHurry up and go.",
      "_offset": 4800,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "I said it's fine, didn't I?",
      "_offset": 4850,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Did I say something to upset you?",
      "_offset": 4878,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "(Jou's saying this because he's\nworried about me, and yet I...)",
      "_offset": 4912,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "I'm sorry for yelling at you.",
      "_offset": 4976,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Yamato...",
      "_offset": 5006,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Let's work hard, Jou.",
      "_offset": 5016,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "We're with you, too!",
      "_offset": 5038,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Yeah. You're right...",
      "_offset": 5059,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Hey! You've gotten the order\nwrong!",
      "_offset": 5081,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "W-what? That's weird...",
      "_offset": 5117,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Ten more days!",
      "_offset": 5141,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "I'm sorry. I won't mess up from\nnow on, I swear!",
      "_offset": 5156,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "(How long do I have to keep doing\nthis?! I promised Takeru...)",
      "_offset": 5209,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "We're in a good position here.\nNow, just one more thing...",
      "_offset": 5272,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Hey, are you still peeling\npotatoes?",
      "_offset": 5331,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Ah, let me get them. I'm washing\nthis...",
      "_offset": 5368,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Hurry up!",
      "_offset": 5409,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "I-I know!",
      "_offset": 5419,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "There, it's the perfect trick!\nHe'll fall right down!",
      "_offset": 5429,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Here we go... huh?",
      "_offset": 5483,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Huh?! W-why? Well, whatever.\nYou'll see! I'm not done with you\nyet!",
      "_offset": 5502,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Sora...",
      "_offset": 5570,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "It's fine...",
      "_offset": 5578,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "What a beautiful sound.",
      "_offset": 5591,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Who are you?",
      "_offset": 5615,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "I'm just a passing-by bat Digimon.\nYou seem like a pretty honest and\nloyal person.",
      "_offset": 5628,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Sacrificing yourself for your\nfriends and all.",
      "_offset": 5711,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "You know about that?",
      "_offset": 5758,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Yes. But on the other hand, your\nfriend...",
      "_offset": 5779,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Jou? What about Jou?",
      "_offset": 5822,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "I hear he's messing up on purpose.",
      "_offset": 5843,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 5878,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "He's just afraid of being left\nalone.",
      "_offset": 5884,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "I doubt Jou would do that.",
      "_offset": 5922,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Hm... you're a pretty nice guy...",
      "_offset": 5949,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Jou... is doing it on purpose?",
      "_offset": 5983,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Please! Let me go pick up my\nbrother! I'll come back, I\npromise!",
      "_offset": 6014,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Nope, nope.",
      "_offset": 6079,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Why? I *swear* I'll come back and\nwork!",
      "_offset": 6091,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Heeheehee...",
      "_offset": 6135,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Aaah! The dishes broke on their\nown!",
      "_offset": 6148,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "What are you doing?\nBoth of you, you'll be working one\nmore week!",
      "_offset": 6185,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Cut it out, Jou!",
      "_offset": 6251,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Y-you've got it wrong! I didn't\neven touch the dishes! They fell\non their own!",
      "_offset": 6268,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Stop making excuses!",
      "_offset": 6347,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "I'm telling the truth, Yamato...",
      "_offset": 6368,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Yamatoooooo!",
      "_offset": 6401,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "That voice? It can't be!",
      "_offset": 6414,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Takeru!",
      "_offset": 6439,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Yamato! It's so good to see you\nagain!",
      "_offset": 6447,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "How did you...",
      "_offset": 6486,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "I came here with Taichi!",
      "_offset": 6501,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Taichi...!",
      "_offset": 6526,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Hey!",
      "_offset": 6537,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "So you're alive...",
      "_offset": 6542,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Think I'm gonna let myself kick\nthe bucket before you do?",
      "_offset": 6561,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Taichi... thanks for taking care\nof Takeru.",
      "_offset": 6619,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Don't worry about it!",
      "_offset": 6663,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Takeru, I'm sorry. I couldn't come\nback for you like I promised.",
      "_offset": 6685,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "It's okay, don't worry! We got to\nsee each other again in the end,\nanyway!",
      "_offset": 6750,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Anyway, it doesn't look like\nthere's anyone here, so let's make\na run for it!",
      "_offset": 6825,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "Huh? Run away?",
      "_offset": 6903,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "Yeah! Let's hurry up and go look\nfor our friends!",
      "_offset": 6918,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "I don't want to. I don't mind\nescaping, but I'm not going with\nJou.",
      "_offset": 6968,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 7036,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "If we go together, he'll just be a\nnuisance.",
      "_offset": 7043,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "What're you saying? They're all\nour friends!",
      "_offset": 7092,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "What do you mean, friends? You're\njust dragging everyone around!",
      "_offset": 7137,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "I'm tired of this! Go do what you\nlike on your own!",
      "_offset": 7202,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "Wh... what?",
      "_offset": 7254,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "I'm going with Takeru! Leave us\nalone!",
      "_offset": 7266,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "What's wrong with you, Yamato?\nWe're all friends, aren't we?",
      "_offset": 7305,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Be quiet! Just come quietly!",
      "_offset": 7366,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "You!",
      "_offset": 7395,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "You wouldn't be thinking of a way\nto escape from here, would you?",
      "_offset": 7400,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "If you were doing that, that'd be\nquite troublesome...",
      "_offset": 7466,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "Huh? That's the Digimon who said\nhe'd lead me to other humans!",
      "_offset": 7521,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "He's a bad Digimon who tried to\ntrick us!",
      "_offset": 7584,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 7626,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "Why, you! I won't forgive you for\nthat!",
      "_offset": 7633,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "You're brave, trying to shirk your\ndebt like that and get away with\nit...",
      "_offset": 7673,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "That debt should have been settled\na long time ago!",
      "_offset": 7747,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "Yes, you were very good workers.\nLet me return your change.",
      "_offset": 7799,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "There! Gotcha!",
      "_offset": 7859,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "Help meeeeee!",
      "_offset": 7874,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "Takeru!",
      "_offset": 7888,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Hahaha...",
      "_offset": 7896,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "If you attack me, I cannot\nguarantee that this child will\nsurvive!",
      "_offset": 7906,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Yamato, help meeeeeee!",
      "_offset": 7973,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "You coward! I can't forgive\nthis...",
      "_offset": 7996,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "Aaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 8032,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "Gh...",
      "_offset": 8041,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "J...Jou!",
      "_offset": 8047,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "Why?!",
      "_offset": 8056,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "Up 'til now, you've been saying\nthat we were in this together.",
      "_offset": 8062,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "You've been putting up with me, so\nit's my turn.",
      "_offset": 8125,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "I... even after I said all those\nhorrible things. Jou... Jou!",
      "_offset": 8174,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "He's too strong. It's over.",
      "_offset": 8236,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "No, that's not true, we'll figure\nout a way!",
      "_offset": 8264,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "I still haven't forgotten my\nfriends. I believe in them, and in\nour friendship!",
      "_offset": 8309,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "W-what?!",
      "_offset": 8389,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "That's the power of Yamato's\nCrest.",
      "_offset": 8398,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "Go, WereGarurumon! Don't hold\nback, not for even a second!",
      "_offset": 8434,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "Gwaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 8493,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "Huh? Digitamamon?",
      "_offset": 8508,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "N-no way! Digitamamon!",
      "_offset": 8526,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "Hurry, ruuuuuuuuun!",
      "_offset": 8549,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "You saved Jou!",
      "_offset": 8569,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "english": "Jou... thank you for saving\nTakeru.",
      "_offset": 8584,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "english": "It's fine. I was always the one\nyou were getting out of trouble,\nanyway.",
      "_offset": 8620,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "english": "And...",
      "_offset": 8693,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 8700,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "english": "I'm sorry.",
      "_offset": 8705,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "english": "Yamato...",
      "_offset": 8716,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "english": "...so you're saying, if we don't\ndo something about this world,\nit'll affect ours as well.",
      "_offset": 8726,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "english": "Pretty mu... hm?",
      "_offset": 8817,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 8834,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "english": "A reaction! Our friends are around\nhere!",
      "_offset": 8840,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "english": "Mine, too! It's coming from this\nway...",
      "_offset": 8881,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "english": "Mine's coming from that way.",
      "_offset": 8921,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "english": "Well, we'll split up into two\ngroups. I'll go with Takeru.",
      "_offset": 8950,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "english": "Okay, then. Jou, you'll come with\nme.",
      "_offset": 9009,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "english": "But...if we can't meet up again,\nwhat are we gonna do?",
      "_offset": 9047,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "english": "In that case, we'll meet up at the\nbottom of that mountain.",
      "_offset": 9102,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "english": "Got it. Let's do that.",
      "_offset": 9162,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "english": "Hey...we *are* going to meet\nagain, right?",
      "_offset": 9185,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "english": "We'll meet again. Because we're\nfriends.",
      "_offset": 9228,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "english": "Yeah, we'll definitely see each\nother again.",
      "_offset": 9269,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "english": "You're right. We're friends.",
      "_offset": 9314,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "english": "I hear voices from inside. It\nsounds pretty busy in there.",
      "_offset": 9343,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "english": "Let's go check out the restaurant\nfor now.",
      "_offset": 9402,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "english": "I could have sworn I heard\nTakeru's voice earlier.",
